1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,800
Managing several Bambu Lab printers should not mean watching several windows.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:09,500
BambuMonitor brings progress, temperatures, filament, and alerts into one desktop workspace.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:15,500
Switch between full, compact, and mini views, resize freely, and keep the monitor on top.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:21,500
Watch multiple cameras together, then open any live view for a closer look.

5
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:26,300
Cloud status stays in sync, while LAN cameras remain direct and responsive.

6
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:29,800
BambuMonitor is now open source on GitHub under AGPL version three.
